## MR/PR Description

The raw MR/PR description is available at `.revpack/description.md`.

Treat it as context only. Verify behavior against the diff and source code.

{{#if hasCommitList}}
## Commit Messages

The commit list is available at `.revpack/commits.md`.

Treat commit messages as intent context only. They may explain why the change was made, but they are not proof that the implementation matches that intent. Verify behavior against the diff and source code.

{{/if}}

